# kali-longtail.src — tools with no clean Ubuntu-native package, built from source.
# This file is documentation/reference; the recipes live in the modules that own
# each tool (sublist3r->30-web pipx, hcxtools->70-wireless build, veil/beef->60).
# Kept here so the decision ("from source, no Kali apt repo") is discoverable.
#
# tool        owner-module        method
# ----------  ------------------  ------------------------------------------------
# sublist3r   30-web              pipx install sublist3r
# crowbar     20-ad-network       pipx install git+https://github.com/galkan/crowbar
# kerberoast  20-ad-network       git clone nidem/kerberoast (scripts, no build)
# hcxtools    70-wireless         git clone + make (needs libssl/libcurl/pkg-config)
# veil        DROPPED             needs wine32 + mono, so x86_64 only, and it is
#                                 unmaintained since 2021. If you want it on an
#                                 x86_64 box: clone Veil-Framework/Veil and run
#                                 config/setup.sh --force --silent by hand.
# beef-xss    60-payload-dev      git clone beefproject/beef + ./install (ruby/bundler)
